    "existing_summary": "Being efficient with tokens doesn't mean using fewer of them overall. It means making sure the ones you do use go towards the thing you actually asked for. So let's look at what decides the price of a token, then what decides how many of them a session sends, and along the way, what that means for how you run a session.",
